package CanvasNet {
    part def VegaLiteDocument {
        doc /* The public API of CanvasNetVegaLite in the DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite namespace: the sealed, immutable, thread-safe VegaLiteDocument with the static Parse(string), Open(string path), and Open(Stream) entry points (strict UTF-8 with an optional byte-order mark, malformed UTF-8 rejected with a located VegaLiteSpecException, source limited to 4,194,304 characters by default, the stream left open and a non-terminating stream bounded), the SourceName, SchemaUrl, SchemaMajorVersion, Title, MarkTypes, DataReferences, and ParameterNames properties that describe the chart from its text alone, the Measure method that computes the size a chart renders at, and the two Render methods that draw the chart onto a new Surface (natural size times the scale, or an exact size with the chart scaled uniformly to fit and centered; invalid size or scale rejected before any report is delivered; warnings and unsupported-feature reports delivered once, in document order, on the calling thread; cancellation honored; byte-identical images from repeated and concurrent calls). The unit includes the immutable, validated VegaLiteOpenOptions (BaseDirectory, DataPaths, FileResolver, SourceName, Limits), VegaLiteRenderOptions (Scale, Background, Config, Parameters, Datasets, TimeZone, ContainerWidth, ContainerHeight, Fonts, Limits, the warning and unsupported-feature handlers, ThrowOnUnsupportedFeature), and VegaLiteFontOptions (UseSystemFonts, AdditionalDirectories); the VegaLiteLimits resource limits; the VegaLiteLocation record struct (file, JSON pointer, one-based line and column); the VegaLiteSpecException (a FormatException carrying the Location of the first problem), the VegaLiteRenderException (an InvalidOperationException carrying the Location of a failed render), and the VegaLiteUnsupportedFeatureException (an IOException carrying the feature and location); the VegaLiteDiagnostic and VegaLiteUnsupportedFeature records; the VegaLiteSize, VegaLiteDataReference, and VegaLiteDataKind types; and the internal VegaLiteReportSink that buffers, de-duplicates, caps, and delivers the reports. It delegates parsing to the internal VegaLiteSpecModel subsystem and the pipeline of data, scales, guides, layout, marks, and painting to the other internal subsystems, and opens no file and uses no network while parsing; only Measure and Render read data, creating one DataLoader per call from the effective open options (the folder of an opened file, BaseDirectory, DataPaths, or the FileResolver callback), the caller's Datasets, and the limits, loading the data before the scene budget is charged, and delivering the data warnings after the reports of the specification; a local data file that cannot be used is a VegaLiteRenderException and a remote URL is reported and never fetched. */

        comment sourceRef /* Source: src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/VegaLiteDocument.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/VegaLiteDocument.Render.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/VegaLiteOpenOptions.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/VegaLiteRenderOptions.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/VegaLiteFontOptions.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/VegaLiteLimits.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/VegaLiteLocation.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/VegaLiteSize.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/VegaLiteDataReference.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/VegaLiteDataKind.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/VegaLiteDiagnostic.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/VegaLiteUnsupportedFeature.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/VegaLiteSpecException.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/VegaLiteRenderException.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/VegaLiteUnsupportedFeatureException.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/VegaLiteReportSink.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/NamespaceDoc.cs */
        comment testRef /* Test: test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/VegaLiteSystemIntegrationTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/VegaLiteChartIntegrationTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/VegaLiteDocumentLayoutTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/SpecModel/VegaLiteDocumentSpecModelTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/VegaLiteOpenOptionsTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/VegaLiteRenderOptionsTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/VegaLiteLimitsTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/VegaLiteLocationTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/VegaLiteRecordsAndExceptionsTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/VegaLiteReportSinkTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/Fixtures/ */
